return ['domain'=>'ai-translator-for-translatepress','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'AI Translator for TranslatePress 0.1.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-09T10:20:30+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.11.0','messages'=>['AI Translator for TranslatePress'=>'AI Translator for TranslatePress','https://github.com/alankongx/ai-translator-for-translatepress'=>'https://github.com/alankongx/ai-translator-for-translatepress','Translation engine for TranslatePress using Google Gemini or any OpenAI-compatible API. Translations are mapped by ID and validated before TranslatePress saves them; failed strings stay untranslated and are retried later instead of being saved wrong.'=>'TranslatePress 的翻译引擎，支持 Google Gemini 和任意 OpenAI 兼容接口。译文按编号对应，并在 TranslatePress 保存前逐条校验；校验不过的文字保持未翻译、稍后重试，绝不存错。','alankongx'=>'alankongx','https://github.com/alankongx'=>'https://github.com/alankongx','AI Translator'=>'AI 翻译','Settings'=>'设置','AI Translator for TranslatePress needs the TranslatePress plugin to be installed and active.'=>'AI Translator for TranslatePress 需要先安装并启用 TranslatePress 插件。','The plugin "HHG for TranslatePress" is also active. Only one translation engine is used at a time (TranslatePress → Automatic Translation → engine). Deactivate HHG after switching to AI Translator to avoid confusion.'=>'「HHG for TranslatePress」插件也处于启用状态。TranslatePress 同一时间只用一个翻译引擎（TranslatePress → 自动翻译 → 引擎）。切换到 AI 翻译后请停用 HHG，以免混淆。','AI Translator: the saved API key can no longer be read (the site\'s secret keys in wp-config.php changed). Please enter the API key again.'=>'AI 翻译：已保存的 API 密钥无法读取（wp-config.php 里的站点密钥变了）。请重新填写 API 密钥。','Open settings'=>'打开设置','AI Translator has paused automatic translation.'=>'AI 翻译已暂停自动翻译。','Details'=>'详情','The API key was rejected. Check the key and the API address.'=>'API 密钥被拒绝。请检查密钥和接口地址。','The provider reports a billing or balance problem. Top up or check the account.'=>'服务商提示账单或余额有问题。请充值或检查账户。','The model or API address was not found. Check the model name.'=>'找不到模型或接口地址。请检查模型名称。','The provider rejected the requests as invalid. Check the model and settings, then run the connection test.'=>'服务商认为请求无效。请检查模型和设置，然后运行连接测试。','Rate limit reached; requests resume automatically.'=>'已达到频率上限，稍后自动恢复。','The provider\'s daily quota is used up; requests resume automatically later.'=>'服务商当天额度已用完，稍后自动恢复。','The provider returned server errors; requests resume automatically.'=>'服务商返回服务器错误，稍后自动恢复。','Requests timed out; requests resume automatically.'=>'请求超时，稍后自动恢复。','Network error while contacting the provider.'=>'连接服务商时网络出错。','The provider returned an unreadable response.'=>'服务商返回的内容无法读取。','The model\'s answers were repeatedly cut off, unreadable or misaligned, so they were discarded; requests resume automatically.'=>'模型的回答接连被截断、无法读取或对位错乱，已全部丢弃；稍后自动恢复。','Not configured yet.'=>'尚未配置。','Open AI Translator settings'=>'打开 AI 翻译设置','The daily character limit above also applies to AI Translator (sent characters, retries included).'=>'上方的每日字符上限同样适用于 AI 翻译（按发送的字符计，含重试）。','paused'=>'已暂停','waiting (temporary)'=>'等待中（临时）','running'=>'运行中','Status & log'=>'状态与日志','Review list'=>'待复核列表','To use this engine, open TranslatePress → Settings → Automatic Translation, turn automatic translation on and choose "AI Translator" as the engine.'=>'要使用这个引擎，请打开 TranslatePress → 设置 → 自动翻译，开启自动翻译并把引擎选为「AI Translator」。','Connection'=>'连接','API type'=>'接口类型','Google Gemini (native API)'=>'Google Gemini（原生接口）','OpenAI-compatible API (OpenAI, DeepSeek, Zhipu, OpenRouter, relays …)'=>'OpenAI 兼容接口（OpenAI、DeepSeek、智谱、OpenRouter、中转站等）','Service'=>'服务','API address'=>'接口地址','Leave empty to use the default address of the selected service. HTTPS only. For relays, enter the address that ends before /chat/completions (often ending in /v1).'=>'留空则使用所选服务的默认地址。只接受 HTTPS。中转站请填到 /chat/completions 之前的部分（通常以 /v1 结尾）。','API key'=>'API 密钥','Set in wp-config.php (AITP_API_KEY).'=>'已在 wp-config.php 中设置（AITP_API_KEY）。','Saved (…%s) — enter a new key to replace it'=>'已保存（…%s）——填写新密钥即可替换','Paste the API key'=>'粘贴 API 密钥','Remove saved key'=>'删除已保存的密钥','Stored encrypted and never shown again. It is only sent to the API address above, in a request header.'=>'加密保存，之后不再显示。只会通过请求头发送到上面的接口地址。','Model'=>'模型','Model name exactly as the provider writes it, e.g. gemini-3.5-flash, gpt-4.1-mini, deepseek-chat.'=>'按服务商写法填写模型名称，例如 gemini-3.5-flash、gpt-4.1-mini、deepseek-chat。','Thinking'=>'思考','Minimal (fastest, recommended)'=>'最少（最快，推荐）','Low'=>'低','Model default'=>'模型默认','Structured output'=>'结构化输出','Automatic (schema → JSON → plain, chosen by what the API accepts)'=>'自动（按接口支持情况依次用 schema → JSON → 纯文本）','JSON mode only'=>'仅 JSON 模式','Off (prompt only)'=>'关闭（只靠提示词）','Temperature'=>'温度','Empty = provider default (recommended for Gemini 3).'=>'留空 = 使用服务商默认值（Gemini 3 推荐留空）。','Translation rules'=>'翻译规则','Protected terms'=>'保护词','One per line. Brand and product names that must appear unchanged (exact spelling and capitals), e.g. OKAY EYEWEAR.'=>'每行一个。必须原样出现的品牌名和产品名（拼写和大小写都不能变），例如 OKAY EYEWEAR。','Glossary'=>'术语表','One rule per line: source term => language: preferred | alternative ; !forbidden. Language can be a code (fr, es_MX) or * for all. Example: tinted lenses => es_MX: micas tintadas | lentes tintados ; !polarizadas'=>'每行一条：源词 => 语言: 首选 | 备选 ; !禁用词。语言可写代码（fr、es_MX），* 表示所有语言。例：tinted lenses => es_MX: micas tintadas | lentes tintados ; !polarizadas','Protected patterns'=>'保护格式','Optional. One regular expression per line (without delimiters); every match must reappear unchanged. Technical standards (EN ISO 12312-1, ANSI Z80.3 …) and model codes (TR90, UV400) are protected automatically.'=>'可选。每行一个正则表达式（不带分隔符）；每个匹配到的内容都必须原样保留。技术标准（EN ISO 12312-1、ANSI Z80.3 等）和型号代码（TR90、UV400）会自动保护。','About the site'=>'网站简介','Short description sent with every request: industry, audience, tone. Example: B2B manufacturer of kids sunglasses and optical frames; formal business tone.'=>'每次请求都会附上的简短说明：行业、受众、语气。例：儿童太阳镜和光学镜架的 B2B 制造商；正式商务语气。','Checks'=>'检查项','Model numbers and material codes must stay unchanged (TR90, UV400, OK-A1001)'=>'型号和材料代码必须保持不变（TR90、UV400、OK-A1001）','Size labels must stay unchanged (S, M, L, XL)'=>'尺码必须保持不变（S、M、L、XL）','Flag added claims (guaranteed, certified, in stock, polarized, reinforced, best …)'=>'标出多加的宣传说法（保证、认证、现货、偏光、加强、最好等）','Flagged translations'=>'被标记的译文','Save them and add them to the review list (recommended)'=>'保存并加入待复核列表（推荐）','Do not save them; keep the original until reviewed'=>'不保存，复核前继续显示原文','Applies to possible meaning changes (added claims, glossary). Broken structure, missing numbers, untranslated or truncated text is never saved.'=>'只针对可能改变意思的情况（多加的说法、术语表）。结构损坏、数字缺失、没翻译或被截断的译文一律不保存。','Performance'=>'性能','Seconds per page view'=>'每次页面访问的秒数','Maximum time spent translating during one page view. Strings not finished are translated on a later view.'=>'一次页面访问里最多花在翻译上的时间。没来得及翻的文字会在之后的访问中继续翻译。','Strings per call'=>'每次调用的文字条数','How many strings TranslatePress hands over at once.'=>'TranslatePress 一次交给引擎多少条文字。','Strings per request'=>'每个请求的文字条数','Source tokens per request'=>'每个请求的原文 token 数','Parallel requests'=>'并行请求数','Lower this if the provider reports rate limits.'=>'服务商提示频率超限时调低这个值。','Request timeout (seconds)'=>'请求超时（秒）','Keep log (days)'=>'日志保留（天）','Connection test'=>'连接测试','Translates two short test sentences with the saved settings and shows exactly what came back. Nothing is saved to TranslatePress.'=>'用已保存的设置翻译两句简短的测试句子，并原样显示返回结果。不会保存到 TranslatePress。','Run connection test'=>'运行连接测试','Connection test passed.'=>'连接测试通过。','Connection test failed.'=>'连接测试失败。','Not translated:'=>'未翻译：','Detected features:'=>'检测到的功能：','Overview'=>'概览','Engine selected in TranslatePress'=>'已在 TranslatePress 中选用此引擎','Yes'=>'是','No'=>'否','Automatic translation'=>'自动翻译','On'=>'开','Off'=>'关','Configured'=>'已配置','(next attempt %s)'=>'（下次尝试 %s）','State'=>'状态','Last error'=>'最近一次错误','Characters sent today (TranslatePress limit)'=>'今天已发送的字符（TranslatePress 上限）','%1$s of %2$s'=>'%1$s / %2$s','Resume now'=>'立即恢复','Last 24 hours'=>'最近 24 小时','Engine calls'=>'引擎调用次数','Strings received'=>'收到的文字条数','Translated and handed to TranslatePress'=>'已翻译并交给 TranslatePress','%s from cache'=>'其中 %s 条来自缓存','Saved with a review flag'=>'已保存但带复核标记','Not translated (left for a later attempt)'=>'未翻译（留待之后重试）','API requests'=>'API 请求数','Characters sent'=>'已发送字符数','Reasons'=>'原因','Strings that keep failing'=>'反复失败的文字','After repeated failures a string is retried less often (5 min, 30 min, 2 h, 12 h). It stays untranslated in TranslatePress meanwhile.'=>'反复失败后，重试间隔会逐步拉长（5 分钟、30 分钟、2 小时、12 小时）。在此期间它在 TranslatePress 中保持未翻译。','None.'=>'无。','Language'=>'语言','Reason'=>'原因','Strings'=>'条数','Waiting'=>'等待中','Latest examples'=>'最近的例子','Retry all now'=>'立即全部重试','Recent log'=>'最近日志','Nothing logged yet.'=>'暂无日志。','Time (UTC)'=>'时间（UTC）','Event'=>'事件','translation too short'=>'译文过短','translation too long'=>'译文过长','sentences missing'=>'句子缺失','returned untranslated'=>'原样返回未翻译','source language left in translation'=>'译文里残留原文语言','numbers changed'=>'数字被改','HTML changed'=>'HTML 被改','HTML broken'=>'HTML 损坏','placeholders changed'=>'占位符被改','link or e-mail changed'=>'链接或邮箱被改','protected term missing'=>'缺少保护词','ordinary word written like the brand'=>'普通词被写成品牌的写法','code or standard changed'=>'代码或标准被改','size label changed'=>'尺码被改','characters of another language'=>'混入其他语言的文字','source characters left in translation'=>'译文里残留原文字符','answer cut off'=>'回答被截断','missing in answer'=>'回答里缺了这一条','answer IDs did not match'=>'回答的编号对不上','answer looked misaligned, all of it discarded'=>'回答疑似对位错乱，整批丢弃','unreadable answer'=>'回答无法读取','blocked by provider safety filter'=>'被服务商安全过滤拦截','time budget used up (next page view)'=>'时间用完（下次访问再翻）','engine paused / waiting'=>'引擎暂停 / 等待中','daily character limit reached'=>'已达每日字符上限','waiting after repeated failures'=>'反复失败后等待重试','structured data (not translated)'=>'结构化数据（不翻译）','empty answer'=>'空回答','answer format leaked into text'=>'回答格式混入了正文','glossary term not used'=>'没用术语表指定的译法','forbidden glossary term used'=>'用了术语表禁用的词','brand added'=>'多加了品牌名','number written in words'=>'数字被写成了文字','added claim: %s'=>'多加的说法：%s','not saved, needs review: %s'=>'未保存，需复核：%s','Translations that passed all hard checks but may change the meaning (added claims, glossary). Correct them in the TranslatePress translation editor if needed, then mark them as reviewed.'=>'这些译文通过了所有硬性检查，但可能改变了原意（多加的说法、术语表）。如需修改，请在 TranslatePress 翻译编辑器中更正，然后标记为已复核。','Open'=>'待处理','Reviewed'=>'已复核','Dismissed'=>'已忽略','Export CSV'=>'导出 CSV','Nothing here.'=>'这里还没有内容。','Original'=>'原文','Translation'=>'译文','Flags'=>'标记','Saved'=>'已保存','Mark as reviewed'=>'标记为已复核','Dismiss'=>'忽略','Reopen'=>'重新打开','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'你没有权限执行此操作。','Enter the API key and model first.'=>'请先填写 API 密钥和模型。','Automatic translation resumed.'=>'自动翻译已恢复。','Failed strings will be retried on the next page view.'=>'失败的文字会在下一次页面访问时重试。','AI Translator (Gemini / OpenAI-compatible)'=>'AI 翻译（Gemini / OpenAI 兼容）','The API address is not a valid URL.'=>'接口地址不是有效的网址。','The API address must start with https://.'=>'接口地址必须以 https:// 开头。','The API address must not contain a user name, password, query string or fragment. Enter the API key in its own field.'=>'接口地址里不能包含用户名、密码、查询参数或锚点。API 密钥请填在单独的字段里。','The API key is too long.'=>'API 密钥过长。','These protected patterns are not valid regular expressions (or match empty text) and are ignored: %s'=>'以下保护格式不是有效的正则表达式（或会匹配空文本），已忽略：%s','These glossary lines could not be read and are ignored: %s'=>'以下术语表行无法识别，已忽略：%s','AI Translator is not configured yet: add the API key and model under Settings → AI Translator.'=>'AI 翻译尚未配置：请在 设置 → AI 翻译 中填写 API 密钥和模型。','Translation engine for TranslatePress using Google Gemini or any OpenAI-compatible API, with ID-based mapping and validation before saving.'=>'TranslatePress 的翻译引擎，支持 Google Gemini 和任意 OpenAI 兼容接口；译文按编号对应，保存前逐条校验。','page redirects elsewhere (not queued again)'=>'页面会跳转到别处（不再排队）','page answered without being processed (a page cache?)'=>'页面有响应但没有经过处理（可能是页面缓存）','the site could not reach its own page'=>'网站访问不到自己的页面','still new strings after several visits; continues later'=>'访问多次后仍有新文字；稍后继续','some strings keep failing; retried later'=>'部分文字一直翻译失败；稍后重试','daily character limit of the queue reached'=>'已达到补翻队列的每日字符上限','TranslatePress daily limit almost used up (reserve kept for visitors)'=>'TranslatePress 每日上限快用完（已为访客预留）','page returned HTTP %s'=>'页面返回 HTTP %s','Visits the translated version of your pages in the background, one page at a time, so TranslatePress translates them before a visitor does. Every translation goes through the same checks as during a normal page view; nothing is written to TranslatePress directly.'=>'在后台一页一页访问各页面的译文版本，让 TranslatePress 在访客到来之前就翻译好。每条译文都经过和正常浏览时相同的校验；不会直接写入 TranslatePress 的数据。','waiting: %1$s (until %2$s)'=>'等待中：%1$s（到 %2$s）','Pages done'=>'已完成页面','Characters used by the queue today'=>'队列今日已用字符','Page list built'=>'页面列表生成时间','not yet'=>'还没有','Background run (WP-Cron)'=>'后台运行（WP-Cron）','scheduled every minute'=>'每分钟运行一次','WP-Cron is disabled on this site; a server cron job must call wp-cron.php, or keep this page open, or use "wp aitp queue run".'=>'本站已关闭 WP-Cron：需要服务器定时任务调用 wp-cron.php，或者保持本页打开，或者运行 "wp aitp queue run"。','not scheduled'=>'未安排','Pause'=>'暂停','Start'=>'开始','Build page list and start'=>'生成页面列表并开始','Rebuild page list'=>'重新生成页面列表','Queue unfinished pages again'=>'未完成的页面重新排队','Check all pages again'=>'所有页面重新检查一遍','Empty the queue'=>'清空队列','Remove all pages from the queue? Translations are not affected.'=>'把所有页面移出队列？已有译文不受影响。','Stop advancing from this page'=>'停止从本页推进','Advance from this page now'=>'从本页立即推进','Progress'=>'进度','The queue is empty. Choose what to translate below, then start.'=>'队列是空的。请在下方选择要翻译的内容，然后开始。','Done'=>'已完成','Partly done'=>'部分完成','Failed'=>'失败','Total'=>'合计','Pages needing attention'=>'需要留意的页面','Page'=>'页面','Next attempt'=>'下次尝试','Strings that fail are listed under Status & log with their reasons.'=>'翻译失败的文字及原因在「状态与日志」里。','What to translate'=>'翻译哪些内容','Languages'=>'语言','Languages configured in TranslatePress.'=>'TranslatePress 里设置的语言。','Content'=>'内容','Published content only. Edited pages are queued again automatically.'=>'只包含已发布的内容。编辑过的页面会自动重新排队。','Extra pages'=>'额外页面','One address per line, in the default language, on this site (e.g. archive or landing pages).'=>'每行一个地址，用默认语言、本站地址（例如归档页或落地页）。','Pages per minute'=>'每分钟页数','Upper limit; a page with many new strings takes longer.'=>'上限；新文字多的页面会更慢。','Daily character limit of the queue'=>'补翻队列每日字符上限','Characters the queue may send per day (0 = only the TranslatePress limit applies).'=>'补翻队列每天最多发送的字符数（0 = 只受 TranslatePress 上限约束）。','Reserve for visitors (%)'=>'为访客预留（%）','The queue stops when the TranslatePress daily limit is used up to this reserve, so live page views can still be translated.'=>'TranslatePress 每日上限用到只剩这部分时，队列停下，留给真实访客浏览时翻译。','Seconds per page'=>'每页秒数','Time budget of one background page visit (10–40).'=>'后台访问一个页面的时间预算（10–40）。','Save and rebuild page list'=>'保存并重新生成页面列表','Saved. %1$s pages, %2$s page/language combinations in the queue.'=>'已保存。共 %1$s 个页面，%2$s 个页面/语言组合在队列中。','Page list rebuilt: %1$s pages, %2$s page/language combinations.'=>'页面列表已重新生成：%1$s 个页面，%2$s 个页面/语言组合。','The queue is running.'=>'补翻队列正在运行。','The queue is paused.'=>'补翻队列已暂停。','%s pages queued again.'=>'%s 个页面重新排队。','The queue is empty.'=>'队列已清空。','working'=>'处理中','page done'=>'页面完成','waiting for the speed limit'=>'等待速度限制','queue is waiting'=>'队列在等待','nothing due right now'=>'现在没有到期的页面','another run is in progress'=>'另一轮正在运行','queue is paused'=>'队列已暂停','%1$s — %2$s of %3$s done'=>'%1$s — 已完成 %2$s / %3$s','Request failed; trying again shortly.'=>'请求失败，稍后重试。','Backfill queue'=>'补翻队列','Home page'=>'首页','Wrong'=>'错误','Probably misplaced'=>'疑似错位','Check meaning'=>'待看意思','Reset, waiting for new translation'=>'已改回，等待重新翻译','Changed since the scan'=>'体检后已变动','All'=>'全部','AI: matches'=>'AI：对得上','AI: does not match'=>'AI：对不上','AI: unsure'=>'AI：不确定','changed since the scan'=>'体检后已变动','translated manually'=>'已人工翻译','row no longer exists'=>'该行已不存在','already untranslated'=>'已经是未翻译','not open'=>'不是待处理状态','backup failed'=>'备份失败','Checks translations TranslatePress already stored (machine translations only) with the same rules used before saving new ones. Nothing is changed by a check. Rows you choose can be set back to "not translated" – they are backed up first and translated again through the backfill queue. Manual translations are never touched.'=>'用保存新译文时同一套规则，检查 TranslatePress 里已经存着的译文（只查机器译文）。体检本身不改任何东西。你选中的行可以改回「未翻译」——改之前先备份，然后由补翻队列重新翻译。人工译文永远不会被动。','not run yet'=>'还没运行','stopped'=>'已停止','finished'=>'已完成','Check'=>'体检','table %1$s of %2$s'=>'第 %1$s / %2$s 张表','Machine translations checked'=>'已检查的机器译文','Started'=>'开始时间','Finished'=>'完成时间','Open findings'=>'待处理问题','Stop check'=>'停止体检','Advance the check from this page now'=>'从本页立即推进体检','Start check'=>'开始体检','Check again'=>'重新体检','Findings'=>'体检结果','All languages'=>'全部语言','All problems'=>'全部问题','Page text and interface text'=>'页面文字和界面文字','Page text'=>'页面文字','Interface text (gettext)'=>'界面文字（gettext）','Any AI result'=>'不限 AI 结果','Found by check or import'=>'体检或导入','Found by check'=>'体检发现','Imported'=>'导入','problem code'=>'问题代码','Filter'=>'筛选','%s findings match.'=>'共 %s 条符合。','Stored translation'=>'现存译文','Problem'=>'问题','interface'=>'界面','Set the selected translations back to "not translated"? They are backed up first and can be rolled back.'=>'把选中的译文改回「未翻译」？改之前会先备份，可以回滚。','Reset selected (backup first)'=>'改回未翻译（先备份）','Reset ALL findings matching the filter (at most %s)? They are backed up first and can be rolled back.'=>'把筛选出的全部问题改回未翻译（最多 %s 条）？改之前会先备份，可以回滚。','Reset all matching (at most %s)'=>'筛选结果全部改回（最多 %s 条）','Not a problem'=>'不是问题','AI check selected'=>'AI 复查所选','AI check all matching (at most %s)'=>'AI 复查筛选结果（最多 %s 条）','After a reset the pages showing these strings are queued again; start the backfill queue (or wait for visitors) to get new translations. Clear CDN or server caches outside WordPress yourself.'=>'改回后，显示这些文字的页面会重新排进补翻队列；开启补翻队列（或等访客访问）就会得到新译文。WordPress 之外的 CDN 或服务器缓存需要你自己清。','Repairs'=>'修复记录','Time'=>'时间','Reset'=>'改回','Skipped'=>'跳过','Pages queued'=>'重新排队的页面','Rolled back'=>'已回滚','Download backup'=>'下载备份','Put the old translations of this repair back? Rows translated manually since then are kept.'=>'把这次修复前的旧译文恢复回去？之后被人工改过的行会保留不动。','Roll back'=>'回滚','Import a candidate list'=>'导入候选清单','JSON or CSV with the columns language, id, original and old (the stored translation); optional table = gettext. A row is added only when id, original and old translation all match the current TranslatePress row and it is still machine translated. Nothing is changed by an import.'=>'JSON 或 CSV，列为 language、id、original、old（现存译文），可选 table = gettext。只有编号、原文、旧译文都和 TranslatePress 当前这一行一致，并且仍是机器译文，才会加入。导入本身不改任何东西。','Import'=>'导入','Check settings'=>'体检设置','Also check interface text (gettext)'=>'也检查界面文字（gettext）','Allow the AI check'=>'允许 AI 复查','Asks the configured model whether each selected translation belongs to its original. Rules cannot catch every short misplaced label; the AI can, but each check costs characters (counted against the TranslatePress daily limit) and the AI can be wrong too. Only runs on rows you select.'=>'让已配置的模型判断每条选中的译文是不是这条原文的。规则抓不全错位的短标签，AI 可以，但每次复查都要花字符（计入 TranslatePress 每日上限），AI 也可能判错。只对你选中的行运行。','Save'=>'保存','Check started. It continues in the background; you can also advance it from this page.'=>'体检已开始，会在后台继续；也可以在本页推进。','Check stopped. Findings so far are kept.'=>'体检已停止，已有结果保留。','Nothing selected.'=>'没有选中任何行。','%1$s translations backed up and reset; %2$s pages queued again.'=>'已备份并改回 %1$s 条译文；%2$s 个页面重新排队。','Skipped: %s.'=>'跳过：%s。','Some strings are not linked to a page (menus, widgets, interface text): every page of %s was queued again.'=>'有些文字没有对应到具体页面（菜单、小工具、界面文字）：%s 的所有页面都重新排队了。','The backfill queue is paused: start it, or the strings are translated again when visitors open the pages.'=>'补翻队列目前暂停：开启它，或者等访客打开页面时重新翻译。','%s translations restored.'=>'已恢复 %s 条译文。','Kept as they are: %s.'=>'保留不动：%s。','%s findings updated.'=>'已更新 %s 条。','The AI check is turned off in the check settings below.'=>'AI 复查在下方体检设置里是关闭的。','AI check: %1$s checked — %2$s do not match, %3$s match, %4$s unsure.'=>'AI 复查：已查 %1$s 条——%2$s 条对不上，%3$s 条对得上，%4$s 条不确定。','%s not checked yet (time or provider limit); run it again.'=>'还有 %s 条没查（时间或接口限制），请再运行一次。','No file, or the file is larger than 10 MB.'=>'没有文件，或文件超过 10 MB。','Import: %1$s rows read, %2$s added. Not added — changed since: %3$s, translated manually: %4$s, missing or unreadable: %5$s.'=>'导入：读到 %1$s 行，加入 %2$s 行。未加入——已变动：%3$s，已人工翻译：%4$s，找不到或读不懂：%5$s。','Saved.'=>'已保存。','%1$s checked, %2$s findings'=>'已检查 %1$s 条，发现 %2$s 条','Audit & repair'=>'体检与修复','structured data damaged'=>'结构化数据被改坏','same translation as an unrelated text'=>'和不相关的原文用了同一段译文','from imported list'=>'来自导入清单','next to misplaced translations'=>'挨着错位的译文','left exactly as the original'=>'和原文一模一样','AI: belongs to another text or incomplete'=>'AI：属于别的原文或不完整','control characters'=>'控制字符','text marked "do not translate" changed'=>'标为「不翻译」的文字被改了','no letters'=>'没有文字']];